  "description": "Meet the Eskute V200 Pro Electric Bike — bold moped styling, exhilarating speed, and next-level performance built for every adventure.\n\nPowered by a 2000W peak brushless motor delivering 99 N·m of torque and speeds of 32–40 MPH, the V200 Pro brings thrilling acceleration and impressive hill-climbing power. Equipped with rugged 20\" × 4.0\" puncture-resistant fat tires and dual suspension featuring a 125mm front fork and rear shock absorption, it delivers enhanced traction, stability, and comfort across city streets, gravel paths, and rugged trails.\n\nFeaturing a powerful 52V 20.8Ah battery with up to 80 miles of range, the V200 Pro keeps you exploring longer. The Shimano 7-speed drivetrain, responsive half-twist throttle, and pedal assist provide flexible riding control, whether you're commuting, cruising, or heading off the beaten path.\n\nComplete with a backlit color display, reliable mechanical disc brakes, and an ergonomically contoured comfort seat, the V200 Pro combines smart functionality with everyday practicality. With an impressive 360 lbs payload capacity, it's designed to handle more of what your adventures demand.\n\nBuilt for riders who crave more power, greater freedom, and unforgettable adventures on every ride.",
